{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02965",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.7,
      "end_seconds": 6.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Let me think, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.36,
      "end_seconds": 12.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.19,
      "end_seconds": 20.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.56,
      "end_seconds": 26.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "yes, that's no problem at all please sit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 28.47,
      "end_seconds": 34.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "I mean, uh, we came because of a sudden high fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.82,
      "end_seconds": 37.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.46,
      "end_seconds": 49.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Right, about... well, one week. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.08,
      "end_seconds": 55.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.96,
      "end_seconds": 63.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "Honestly, a few times a day. And a widespread sunburn-like rash, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.76,
      "end_seconds": 68.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "and what about cough, sore throat or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.5,
      "end_seconds": 74.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "No, no cough, sore throat or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.96,
      "end_seconds": 78.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.95,
      "end_seconds": 82.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.71,
      "end_seconds": 88.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.52,
      "end_seconds": 91.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.21,
      "end_seconds": 97.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Right, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 99.7,
      "end_seconds": 113.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.39,
      "text": "He takes iron tablets, once a day. Hmm, he takes clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day. Erm, he takes a tampon, in use."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.82,
      "end_seconds": 117.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.45,
      "end_seconds": 122.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Low haemoglobin, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.85,
      "end_seconds": 126.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.23,
      "end_seconds": 140.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "I mean, I have heart disease, for about a year. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.16,
      "end_seconds": 146.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Alright, heart disease, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.01,
      "end_seconds": 168.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.6,
      "end_seconds": 172.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.28,
      "end_seconds": 181.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.28,
      "end_seconds": 188.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "mm, I'm allergic to amoxicillin, I get a rash all over"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.02,
      "end_seconds": 191.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.8,
      "end_seconds": 197.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.88,
      "end_seconds": 201.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.09,
      "end_seconds": 207.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.6,
      "end_seconds": 210.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.31,
      "end_seconds": 216.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.8,
      "end_seconds": 220.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.01,
      "end_seconds": 225.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.11,
      "end_seconds": 242.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.82,
      "end_seconds": 248.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Just two stents put in my heart, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.09,
      "end_seconds": 252.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.9,
      "end_seconds": 265.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.51,
      "end_seconds": 287.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 99, temp 36.5 degrees, respiratory rate 19. And blood pressure 98 over 61."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.22,
      "end_seconds": 292.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.88,
      "end_seconds": 294.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.9,
      "end_seconds": 297.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.59,
      "end_seconds": 315.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "You are very hot, your blood pressure is low and there is a flat red rash over the body and palms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.13,
      "end_seconds": 317.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.46,
      "end_seconds": 322.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.45,
      "end_seconds": 351.23,
      "duration_seconds": 12.78,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like possible toxic shock syndrome. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.3,
      "end_seconds": 355.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "ah, will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.66,
      "end_seconds": 387.4,
      "duration_seconds": 31.74,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible toxic shock syndrome do well once it's treated properly i want blood cultures done, that's for possible toxic shock let's book a vaginal swab to look into possible toxic shock remove any tampon, you are going to hospital now don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day the emergency team would be the right next step, I'll refer you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.46,
      "end_seconds": 405.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.53,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Book a review straight away. Alright, before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.05,
      "end_seconds": 411.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.43,
      "end_seconds": 417.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.47,
      "end_seconds": 424.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Mm, um, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}